        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Peter Hansen, Kathleen Turner, Danny DeVito, Michael Douglas\n- Roles: Lee Baldwin\n- Works: General Hospital, The War of the Roses\n- Topics: Acting awards\n\nFacts:\n- Peter Franklin Hansen was an American actor who was born on December 5, 1921, and died on April 9, 2017.\n- Peter Hansen played the lawyer Lee Baldwin on the soap opera General Hospital from 1965 to 1976, from 1977 to 1986, briefly in 1990, and again from 1992 to 2004.\n- In 1989, Peter Hansen appeared in the movie The War of the Roses with Danny DeVito, Kathleen Turner, and Michael Douglas.\n- Mary Kathleen Turner was born on June 19, 1954, and is an American film and stage actress and director.\n- Kathleen Turner is known for her distinctive husky voice, has won two Golden Globe Awards, and has been nominated for an Academy Award.",
